.\AGENTCHECK_STAGE_LOG.md:3:## A2 - Entire Checkpoint to AgentCheckContext
.\AGENTCHECK_STAGE_LOG.md:7:Goal: Build the context foundation that adapts Entire checkpoint/session/Git/Graph evidence into a stable AgentCheck contract.
